00:06:22,105 --> 00:06:28,105
It will take you a million light years from home. But will it bring you back?

2
00:12:44,210 --> 00:12:50,210
Stargate is a action, adventure, science fiction
film directed by Roland Emmerich.

3
00:19:06,315 --> 00:19:12,315
An interstellar teleportation device, found in Egypt, leads to a planet with
humans resembling ancient Egyptians who worship the god Ra.

4
00:25:28,421 --> 00:25:34,421
Dr. Daniel Jackson, played by James Spader.

5
00:31:50,526 --> 00:31:56,526
Colonel Jonathan 'Jack' O'Neil, played by Kurt Russell.

6
00:38:12,631 --> 00:38:18,631
Ra, played by Jaye Davidson.

7
00:44:34,736 --> 00:44:40,736
Catherine, played by Viveca Lindfors.

8
00:50:56,842 --> 00:51:02,842
